  "$comment": "Relay / custom-endpoint input capability overrides as deltas. Each end normalizes (connection, legacy relayCapabilityOverrides, stored capabilityOverrides, serverVerdict, now) into expect.capabilityOverrides and expect.effective. Only vision_input / file_input / video_input may be overridden; op is add or remove; keys the user never touched follow the server (effective null). Legacy {value, source:user} for image / file migrates once (setAt = now, baseVerdict = server state for that key, unknown when absent); source:tested is a probe result, not a user choice, and is not migrated. Legacy keys other than image / file stay in the legacy field untouched. Official connections never carry overrides. Bad entries are dropped one by one. Projection of the effective op (who wins against hard blocks / negative cache) lives in capability_evidence_contract.v1.json inputCapabilityCases.",
